# Eclipse VII — Event Horizon V4.1 Hedonism-First Resource-Constrained Blind Validation

**Status:** THEORY PLAN ONLY / NO PREPARATION OR EXECUTION AUTHORIZED  
**Candidates:** V4.1-U Gravity Skin Hedonic Edit and V4.1-F Dark Corona Hedonic Edit  
**Primary objective:** choose by blinded pleasure and desire to smell again, not by complexity, DHP resemblance, material count, model score, or the author's narrative.

## Governing correction

The V4 controls treated elaborate structure as an upstream requirement. V4.1 reverses that causal direction. A perfume may be simple or complex. It advances only if the blinded experience is more pleasurable, comfortable, coherent, and worth smelling again. Any DHP-like anatomy is descriptive evidence after the fact, never a pass condition.

## Resource ceiling

The first direction screen consumes **1,200 uL total concentrate**: one 600-uL unisex nucleus and one 600-uL feminine-leaning nucleus. At 20% finished concentration, this produces two 3-mL coded samples. No full 6,000-uL concentrate is made until one direction earns advancement and separate compounding/safety authority exists.

The direction nuclei are intentionally compressed and are **not exact replicas** of the full formulas. They test the central pleasure propositions while excluding many microdose and finishing rows that would otherwise force a 6,000-uL preparation under the 10-uL direct raw-stock floor. Success at this stage validates only the direction, not the final formula.

