Every direct raw-stock aliquot in both nuclei is at least 10 uL. No sub-floor pipetting is authorized. Naturals and held w/w/w/v stocks retain their exact diagnostic limitations.

## Preparation Controls — Only If Later Authorized

1. One person prepares and codes the samples; the assessor must not see formulas, row counts, direction labels, or intended gender coding.
2. Bring each 600-uL nucleus to exactly 3.00 mL with the same verified ethanol system. Match any added carrier introduced by a necessary bottle-bound preparation; do not silently treat DPG and DEP as interchangeable.
3. Use identical opaque atomizers or identical blotter application volume. Record sample mass before and after only if the method is already available; no new equipment purchase is implied.
4. Evaluate in two sessions with reversed order: AB in one session and BA in the other. Use independently randomized codes and at least a 24-hour separation to reduce memory/order carryover.
5. Do not put either sample on skin until formula-specific safety clearance exists. Blotter-only testing is the default theory plan.

## Predeclared Windows and Questions

Record free description before seeing any scale.

| Window | Primary forced decision | Secondary ratings, each 0–10 | Veto terms to record verbatim |
|---|---|---|---|
| 5 min | Which do I enjoy more right now? U / F / tie | pleasure; desire to smell again; comfort | harsh citrus, hot pepper, orange candy, shampoo, chemical blast |
| 30 min | Which feels more coherent and attractive? U / F / tie | pleasure; re-smell desire; tactile softness; identity clarity | lipstick, peach jam, rubber, smoke, empty Hedione, muddiness |
| 4 h | Which trail would I choose to wear? U / F / tie | pleasure; warmth; persistence quality; fatigue | laundry musk, sandal cream, generic woody amber, sweetness, flat residue |
| 24 h, optional | Is a recognizable pleasant trace present? yes / no / cannot judge | pleasure only if evaluable | do not score an absent trace as failure without application control |

Gender coding, complexity, spatial planes, and DHP resemblance may be described after the forced decisions, but they do not influence advancement.

## Advancement Rule

A direction advances only when all of the following are true:

1. it wins both **pleasure** and **desire to smell again** in at least two of the three required windows across the paired AB/BA sessions, or the assessor records a stable all-day wear preference;
2. the preference does not reverse solely with presentation order;
3. it triggers no repeated identity-destroying veto; and
4. any numerical difference is supported by the free description, not used as a substitute for it.

If results tie or reverse by order, the honest result is **NO WINNER / HOLD**. Do not average away a meaningful reversal. Both full formulas remain theory candidates.

## Stage 2 — One Defect-Driven Pair Only

Only the winning direction is prepared again, as one fresh 600-uL control and one fresh 600-uL variant. Select exactly one variant from the observed defect; do not run a broad factorial.

| Observed defect | U variant | F variant | Constant-total replacement |
|---|---|---|---|
| musk/laundry/fruit fatigue | omit 20 uL Habanolide | omit 30 uL Ambrettolide stock | matching carrier/matrix, bottle-bound |
| excessive woody haze | Iso E 100 -> 80 uL | Iso E 80 -> 60 uL | +20 uL DEP |
| excessive cream | Ebanol 50 -> 35 uL | Ebanol 50 -> 35 uL | +15 uL DEP |
| opening harshness | omit Black Pepper 10 and reduce Cedrat 15 -> 10 | not applicable; inspect mandarin/pink-pepper description first | +15 uL DEP for U |
| fruit/jam in F | not applicable | omit Osmanthus stock 15 uL | +15 uL DPG, subject to carrier match |
| powder/lipstick in F | not applicable | AIMI 25 -> 15 uL | +10 uL DEP |

The defect pair uses the same AB/BA method. The simpler arm wins on a tie. Total pre-full-formula concentrate consumption is at most **2,400 uL**: 1,200 uL for Stage 1 plus 1,200 uL for one Stage-2 pair.

## Stage 3 — Exact Full Candidate Gate

An exact V4.1 full build is not prepared until:

- a direction and any one module correction survive blinded testing;
- Pink Pepper identity is synchronized or bottle-bound for the execution record;
- formula-specific safety and natural-composite review is complete;
- Ambrox, Evernyl, and other held quantitative mappings are handled by an approved mass/stock method rather than invented active-uL arithmetic; and
- the user separately authorizes preparation.

Because the full formula contains 10-uL rows, an exact direct-stock volume build requires the full 6,000-uL concentrate unless separately prepared labeled working stocks are authorized. No two full candidates are made “just to see.” Only the blinded winner may advance.

## Evidence Ceiling

Passing a nucleus screen does not prove the full formula. Failing a nucleus does not prove every full-formula finishing row is bad. No result here establishes consumer-market preference, safety, stability, similarity, luxury, depth, sillage, longevity, or release. Until physical blinded evaluation occurs, both candidates are **NOT TESTED**.
